Revision history for Game-Merrills

0.03    2026-10-13
	- Add options, the fields a launcher offers before a game
	- The keys, the screen, the steering and the log are Game::Terminal::Kit's
	- Requires perl 5.14
	- The choosing screen is drawn over the last one, with no clear between
	- Escape gives up a command typed after : and NO_COLOR=0 turns colour off
	- to_text and from_text carry flying, a standing draw offer, a resignation, a timeout and an agreed draw
	- u and r, or undo and redo, take a turn back and play it again

0.02    2026-10-11
	- Add Game::Merrills::Terminal->run(@argv), which returns the exit status

0.01    2026-10-08
	- First version
